<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac appoints senior executive.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac appoints senior executive.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp said on Wednesday it had appointed general manager, transactional services, Leslie Martin as chief operations officer.</p>
<p>Martin will join the executive team heading up the bank's institutional and international banking group, Westpac said.</p>
<p>She replaces Michael Cannon-Brookes who left recently.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
